<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
== Private servers ==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
There are few official VRChat Discord servers that are private, and available by invite only. The invites to these servers are handed out to people enrolled in obscure VRChat programs, typically for closed testing or moderation.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== VRChat General Testing ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
''See also [[Special:MyLanguage/Quality Assurance|Quality Assurance]] for more detailed information.''
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
Also referred to as "Green", VRChat General Testing is a private server dedicated to communication for various types of closed beta tests.
</div>
[[File:VRChat green Discord Icon.webp|thumb|<span lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">VRChat General Testing</span>|128x128px|none]]
<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== VRChat Community Testers ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
''See also [[Special:MyLanguage/Quality Assurance|Quality Assurance]] for more detailed information.''
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
The '''VRChat Community Testers''' server consists of a select few community members chosen by the VRChat QA team, for their exceptional dedication to providing a numerous quantity of high-quality bug reports. They assist and communicate directly with the QA team on internal testing and bug fixes.
</div>
[[File:Community_Testers_Server.png|thumb|<span lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">VRChat Community Testers</span>|128x128px|none]]
<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== VRC World & Group Sellers ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
This server serves as where [[Worlds|world]] creators and group owners selected for the [[Creator Economy]] program are able to communicate with VRChat regarding the Creator Economy, and vice-versa.
</div>
[[File:VRChat CE Discord Icon.webp|thumb|<span lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">VRC World & Group Sellers</span>|128x128px|none]]
<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== VRC Avatar Marketplace Sellers ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
This server serves as where [[Avatars|avatar]] creators selected for the [[Avatar Marketplace]] program are able to communicate with VRChat regarding the Avatar Marketplace, and vice-versa.
</div>
[[File:VRChat AVM Discord Icon.webp|thumb|<span lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">VRC Avatar Marketplace Sellers</span>|128x128px|none]]
<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== VRChat Community Leaders ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
This server operates as a centralized place for community leaders to work together, share information between peers, report bugs and maintain a connection with the VRChat's community lead to help focus user feedback.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
The server was created on September 4, 2024 and was closed August 21, 2026.
</div> 
[[File:VRChat Community Leaders Discord Icon.webp|thumb|<span lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">VRChat Community Leaders</span>|128x128px|none]]
